WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand tall holding a strap behind your hips with both hands.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Straighten the arms and draw the strap away from the body.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift the chest without flaring the ribs.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the neck long.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then release slowly.
